{
  "question": "How many price quotes must an NYC contracting officer try to get for an M/WBE small purchase?",
  "status": "answered",
  "answer": "For an M/WBE small purchase, a New York City contracting officer must attempt to obtain at least three price quotes from M/WBE vendors or document their inability to do so. This rule is found in the NYC PPB Rules for small purchases.",
